sv-alert-level-silver = Silver
sv-alert-level-silver-announcement = Anomalous activity has been detected aboard the station. The phenomenon is unclassified and no countermeasures are confirmed. Avoid affected sections, document irregularities, and defer to Science and Security.
sv-alert-level-silver-instructions = Document irregularities, avoid affected sections, and defer to Science and Security.

